    "created_at": "2020-12-10T21:50:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-12-10T21:50:32Z",
    "body": "Another case of aborting scripts (not killing scripts though) is `Worker.terminate`.\r\nAlthough I'm not sure the QuotaExceededError is observable in this case in the spec, Blink does nothing (e.g. does not reject promises for dynamic import()s, doesn't crash the renderer) after aborting scripts, and V8 seems disallow accessing V8 APIs after aborting.\r\n\r\nWPT:\r\n\r\n- workers/Worker-terminate-forever-during-evaluation.html\r\n- https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/2586206",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
